-- הסכם קיבוצי (הסתדרות המורים, 2008) — ותק למענק יובל: 25 שנה במקום 30.
-- Between the State and הסתדרות המורים, for every teaching-scale employee
-- of the State (§2), from 1.6.08 (§3): the accumulated teaching seniority
-- that gives the jubilee grant is 25 years, in place of the 30 that §11 of
-- the collective agreement of 19.9.94 sets, from the salary of June 2008
-- (§4(א)); the grant's other rules stand (§4(ב)); exhaustion of claims
-- (§5); and the differences paid with the salary of August 2008, and of
-- September at the latest (§6). The day of signing is written in by hand
-- and its day and month are illegible; the corpus dates it 27.8.2008, and
-- no rule turns on it: the agreement sets its own start.
--
-- THE AGREEMENT OF 19.9.94, whose §11 is the jubilee grant, is not encoded:
-- what it gives besides the seniority this agreement changes is named
-- below as not yet encoded. The seniority it required, 30 years, this
-- agreement itself states ("במקום 30 שנה כמפורט בסעיף האמור").

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — ותק למענק יובל: 25 שנה במקום 30 (הסתדרות המורים, 2008)`

DECLARE `jubilee seniority agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the differences of the jubilee seniority agreement`
    `negotiate further on the jubilee seniority`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp: registered on 16.11.200-, its year and number partly illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The day of signing, written in by hand and illegible but for the year 2008; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 הסתדרות המורים and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the State's teaching employees have begun moving to the employment and pay of the Ofek Hadash reform.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the parties negotiated the terms of all the State's teaching employees, during the move too.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: they agreed to lower the seniority the jubilee grant requires.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the parties set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p16 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 המבוא`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the jubilee seniority agreement's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

-- Every employee in the State's service ranked in the teaching
-- employees' scale; both conditions together (convention reading.lists).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `employed in the State's service` IS A BOOLEAN, `in the teaching scale` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority agreement applies to` `employed in the State's service` `in the teaching scale` IF
    `employed in the State's service` AND `in the teaching scale`

§§ `3 תחילת ההסכם`

@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
`the jubilee seniority agreement starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008

§§ `4 ותק למענק יובל`

-- (א): from the salary paid for June 2008 — the month the jubilee grant
-- for the school year תשס"ח is paid — the accumulated teaching seniority
-- that gives the grant under §11 of the agreement of 19.9.94 is 25 years,
-- in place of the 30 that section sets. The salary month itself decides
-- (convention dates.salary-month). §11 asks "30 שנה ומעלה": 25 takes the
-- place of 30 in the same words, so 25 years and more.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a
`the jubilee seniority §11 of 19.9.94 sets, as this agreement states it` MEANS 30
`the jubilee seniority this agreement sets` MEANS 25

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority required in the salary of` `the salary month` IS
    IF `the salary month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008)
    THEN `the jubilee seniority this agreement sets`
    ELSE `the jubilee seniority §11 of 19.9.94 sets, as this agreement states it`

GIVEN `the salary month` IS A DATE, `accumulated teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the jubilee seniority in the salary of` `the salary month` `accumulated teaching seniority` IF
    `accumulated teaching seniority` AT LEAST `the jubilee seniority required in the salary of` `the salary month`

-- (ב): nothing here changes the jubilee grant's other rules — who counts
-- seniority where, the grant's rate, its month, the position — which are
-- §11 of 19.9.94's, not encoded yet.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the jubilee seniority agreement changes the grant's other rules` MEANS FALSE

`why the jubilee grant's other rules are not here` MEANS
    `not yet encoded` "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 19.9.94, סעיף 11 (מענק יובל)"

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- A full and final exhaustion of the parties' claims on the matters it
-- settles, and no further negotiation on them.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN `on a matter this agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the jubilee seniority agreement exhausts the claim` `on a matter this agreement settled` IF
    `on a matter this agreement settled`

`no further negotiation on the jubilee seniority` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further on the jubilee seniority`

§§ `6 ביצוע ותשלומים`

-- The differences the agreement gives are paid with the salary of August
-- 2008, and of September 2008 at the latest: the State pays them, and a
-- payment with a later salary is late.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1
`paying the differences of the jubilee seniority agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the differences of the jubilee seniority agreement`

GIVEN `paid with the salary of` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the jubilee differences are paid in time with the salary of` `paid with the salary of` IF
    `paid with the salary of` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2008)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The file number (שכ. 2008-4496); no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- A teacher of 27 years: no grant in the salary of June 2007, the grant in
-- that of June 2008; 25 years is enough, 24 is not.
#ASSERT NOT `has the jubilee seniority in the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2007) 27
#ASSERT `has the jubilee seniority in the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2008) 27
#ASSERT `has the jubilee seniority in the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2009) 25
#ASSERT NOT `has the jubilee seniority in the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2009) 24
#ASSERT `the jubilee seniority agreement applies to` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the jubilee seniority agreement applies to` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `the jubilee differences are paid in time with the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008)
#ASSERT NOT `the jubilee differences are paid in time with the salary of` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2008)
